			<item>
				<title>Thiết lập môi trường Python</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.1-setup-python/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.1-setup-python/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;thiết-lập-môi-trường-python&#34;&gt;Thiết lập môi trường Python&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Để chạy được mã nguồn giả lập xe tải, máy tính của bạn cần được cài đặt Python và thư viện kết nối IoT của AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Kiểm tra phiên bản Python trên máy tính bằng cách mở Terminal/Command Prompt và gõ lệnh:&#xA;&lt;code&gt;python --version&lt;/code&gt; (Yêu cầu phiên bản 3.9 trở lên).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aws-project/images/IoTSentinel/1-chuan-bi/python-check.png?featherlight=false&amp;amp;width=90pc&#34; alt=&#34;Kiểm tra Python&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol start=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cài đặt Python (Dành cho máy chưa có):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Với Windows:&lt;/strong&gt; Truy cập trang &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.python.org/downloads/&#34;&gt;python.org/downloads&lt;/a&gt;, tải bộ cài đặt mới nhất.&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lưu ý quan trọng:&lt;/strong&gt; Ở màn hình cài đặt đầu tiên, BẮT BUỘC phải tích chọn ô &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Add Python.exe to PATH&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; trước khi nhấn Install Now. Điều này giúp Terminal nhận diện được lệnh &lt;code&gt;python&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Mã nguồn Truck Simulator</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.2-code/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.2-code/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;tạo-file-mã-nguồn-giả-lập&#34;&gt;Tạo file mã nguồn giả lập&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Chúng ta sẽ tạo một file Python đóng vai trò là cảm biến thông minh trên xe tải. [cite_start]File này có nhiệm vụ mô phỏng dữ liệu hành trình của 10 xe tải và gửi lên AWS Cloud qua giao thức MQTT. [cite: 1]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Mở trình soạn thảo &lt;strong&gt;VS Code&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Tạo một file mới với tên &lt;strong&gt;truck_simulator.py&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Copy và dán đoạn mã dưới đây vào file:&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; time&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; json&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; random&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTPythonSDK.MQTTLib &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTMQTTClient&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# 🔴 CẤU HÌNH THÔNG SỐ (SẼ CẬP NHẬT Ở CHƯƠNG 2)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# Endpoint này sẽ lấy từ AWS IoT Core Settings&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;IOT_ENDPOINT &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;YOUR_AWS_IOT_ENDPOINT&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# Đường dẫn đến các chứng chỉ bảo mật&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_ROOT_CA &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;certs/AmazonRootCA1.pem&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_CERT &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;certs/your-certificate.pem.crt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_PRIVATE_KEY &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;certs/your-private.pem.key&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CLIENT_ID &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Vaccine_Fleet_Simulator&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;TOPIC &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;telemetry/trucks&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# Tạo danh sách giả lập 10 xe tải với tọa độ gốc&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRUCKS &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [{&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;T-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;i&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;lat&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10.7626&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; (i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.01&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;lon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;106.6602&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; (i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.01&lt;/span&gt;)} &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; range(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;)]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# KHỞI TẠO KẾT NỐI MQTT BẢO MẬT&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTMQTTClient(CLIENT_ID)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;configureEndpoint(IOT_ENDPOINT, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;8883&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;configureCredentials(PATH_TO_ROOT_CA, PATH_TO_PRIVATE_KEY, PATH_TO_CERT)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Đang kết nối đến AWS IoT Core...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# VÒNG LẶP GỬI DỮ LIỆU (1 GIÂY/LẦN)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    myMQTTClient&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;connect()&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    print(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;✅ Kết nối thành công!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; truck &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; TRUCKS:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# Sinh dữ liệu ngẫu nhiên cho nhiệt độ và vị trí&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            data &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;truck_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: truck[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;],&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;temperature&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(random&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2.0&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;8.0&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;),&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;latitude&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(truck[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;lat&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; random&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;),&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;longitude&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(truck[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;lon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; random&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;),&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;timestamp_ms&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: int(time&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;time() &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1000&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            }&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            payload &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; json&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;dumps(data)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            myMQTTClient&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;publish(TOPIC, payload, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            print(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;truck[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;id&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;] Đã gửi: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;payload&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;            &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        time&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;sleep(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;) &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;except&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;KeyboardInterrupt&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    print(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;🛑 Đã dừng gửi dữ liệu.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    myMQTTClient&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;disconnect()&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aws-project/images/IoTSentinel/1-chuan-bi/save_code.png?featherlight=false&amp;amp;width=90pc&#34; alt=&#34;Lưu mã nguồn Truck Simulator&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
	</channel>
